# ============================================================
# DuckDuckGo Board Game - Unity
# Este archivo está en la raíz del repositorio.
#
# Estructura actual:
# Project_DuckDuckClub/QuackQuackClub/
# ├── Assets/
# ├── Packages/
# ├── ProjectSettings/
# └── Library/
#
# IMPORTANTE:
# No añadir "/" al principio de las carpetas generadas por
# Unity, porque el proyecto Unity no está en la raíz.
# ============================================================


# ============================================================
# UNITY - ARCHIVOS Y CARPETAS GENERADOS
# ============================================================

.utmp/
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/

# Builds generadas
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/

# Logs
*.log

# Archivos temporales de Blender
*.blend1
*.blend1.meta


# ============================================================
# UNITY - PLUGINS Y ARCHIVOS GENERADOS
# ============================================================

# Plugin generado automáticamente por JetBrains Rider
**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# Configuración personal de Rider
*.DotSettings.user

# Archivos generados por Unity Visual Scripting
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Flow/UnitOptions.db
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Flow/UnitOptions.db.meta
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Core/Property Providers/
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Core/Property Providers.meta

# Caché generado dentro de Assets
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]ceneDependencyCache*

# Escenas generadas automáticamente por Play Mode Tests
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ii]nit[Tt]est[Ss]cene*.unity*
InitTestScene*.unity*


# ============================================================
# UNITY ADDRESSABLES
# ============================================================

# Datos del servidor generados por Addressables
[Ss]erver[Dd]ata/

# Contenido generado de StreamingAssets
**/[Aa]ssets/StreamingAssets/aa*

# Archivos temporales y generados de Addressables
**/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/link.xml*
**/[Aa]ssets/Addressables_Temp*
**/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/*/*.bin*


